    <recordLookups>
        <description>Queries all GiftTransaction records that qualify for acknowledgement: Status = Paid, TransactionDate on or before frmThreeDaysAgo, AcknowledgementStatus blank or To Be Sent, and category is not Fee/Payment. External-tool integrations that already sent their own thank-you should have written AcknowledgementStatus = Sent to opt out of this flow.</description>
